    "updated_at": "2018-02-17T21:08:48Z",
    "body": "Just tested this and agree that the behavior can be problematic. I'm not sure how the HTML spec relates to `Element.name` being used as a JavaScript identifier, but there should be at least one remark addressing this behavior nonetheless.\r\n\r\nShould these additions be done with `<p class=\"note\">` or something else instead?",
